---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { profile } from '../content/site';
---
<Legal title="Cookie Policy" description="This site sets no cookies and stores nothing in your browser." lede="This site sets no cookies and stores nothing in your browser.">
  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <p>This site does not use cookies, local storage or any other way of saving data on your device. It has no advertising, analytics or tracking technology, so there is no cookie banner.</p>
  <h2>What this site does not use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No cookies of any kind.</li>
    <li>No local storage or session storage.</li>
    <li>No analytics or tracking tools.</li>
    <li>No social media buttons or embedded videos that set their own cookies.</li>
    <li>No fingerprinting.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Other sites you may visit</h2>
  <p>If you follow a link to another website, such as my textbooks, project sites, GitHub or Google Drive, that site may set its own cookies. They are covered by that site’s policy, not this one.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
